SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Dave Stone
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Based in Los Angeles by way of Atlanta\, Dave Stone made his te
 levision debut on "The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson" in 2013 and in t
 he same year was selected to the prestigious "New Faces" roster of the Just
  For Laughs Festival in Montreal. Since then\, he has been seen on season 8
  of NBC's "Last Comic Standing"\, Viceland's "Flophouse"\, and Travel Chann
 el's "Cheat Day Chow Down".\n\nWhen not headlining clubs across the country
 \, Dave can be heard voicing several characters on Adult Swim's "Squidbilli
 es"\, co-hosting his paranormal podcast "The Boogie Monster" with Kyle Kina
 ne\, and co-hosting "The Stonebergs Podcast" with his fiancé\, Katie Stran
 dberg.\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which ca
 n be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: 
 Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the tw
 o-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from 
 entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patron
 s.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room
